From: nuno407 <11352538+nuno407@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 14:51:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 33/45] ARM: tegra: surface-rt: the front camera (CAM1) is
 mounted upright

Only the rear camera (CAM2) is mounted upside down; a capture from CAM1
with rotation 180 came out upside down.
---
 arch/arm/boot/dts/nvidia/tegra30-microsoft-surface-rt.dts | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm/boot/dts/nvidia/tegra30-microsoft-surface-rt.dts b/arch/arm/boot/dts/nvidia/tegra30-microsoft-surface-rt.dts
index 123c1f7c2..e72b564db 100644
--- a/arch/arm/boot/dts/nvidia/tegra30-microsoft-surface-rt.dts
+++ b/arch/arm/boot/dts/nvidia/tegra30-microsoft-surface-rt.dts
@@ -337,8 +337,8 @@ front_camera: camera@10 {
 			dovdd-supply = <&vdd_1v8_cam>;
 
 			orientation = <0>;
-			/* both modules are mounted upside down (CAM2 verified) */
-			rotation = <180>;
+			/* mounted upright; the rear module (CAM2) is upside down (both verified) */
+			rotation = <0>;
 
 			port {
 				front_camera_output: endpoint {
-- 
2.47.3

